.vercel
node_modules
.DS_STORE
dist/
# The skill's own library and scripts — 2.5MB of reference material that is a
# tool, not part of this site. `skills-lock.json` records which skill and
# version is in use, which is the part worth tracking.
.agents/
.claude/

# The supplied RecovLoop handover: 5.3MB of PNGs wrapped in SVG containers,
# one per background. Source material, not a build input — the usable assets
# are generated from it into public/recovloop, where the same logo is 3.4KB.
# Keep the original somewhere shared rather than in the site repo.
RecovLoop_SVG_Developer_Pack/

# The skill's working directory: screenshots and inspector reports.
.taste-skill/
.env
